[gd_scene load_steps=5 format=3]

; Painted Storybook cottage.
;
; Collision is kept completely separate from the decorative geometry: two box
; shapes stand in for a 4,600-triangle model with a roof overhang, a chimney
; and a window box. Chuck can only ever walk into the walls and trip over the
; doorstep, so those are the only two things the physics server needs to know
; about, and a convex pair is far cheaper than any shape derived from the mesh.
;
; The collision box stops at the eaves. The roof overhangs it by 0.3 m, which
; is correct: the player should be able to stand under the eaves.

[ext_resource type="PackedScene" path="res://assets/storybook/cottage.glb" id="1"]
[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://storybook/storybook_surface.gd" id="Surface"]

